Catalogue order, duplicate names across sections and full-text search use a portable virtual man tree.
-- tree/man3/tool.3 --
.TH TOOL 3
.SH NAME
tool \- library function
-- tree/man1/tool.1 --
.TH TOOL 1
.SH NAME
tool \- useful command
.SH OPTIONS
Searchable quasar text.
-- tree/man3/ssl.3ssl --
.TH SSL 3ssl
.SH NAME
ssl \- TLS helper
